<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/408700256/egidrukalamasumu> dcterms:creator <https://pleiades.stoa.org/author/jnovotny>;
    dcterms:description "The Sumerian ceremonial name of the temple of the god Nabû of the ḫarû at Assur is Egidrukalamasumu, which means “House Which Bestows the Scepter of the Land.” The name is based on the Nabû of the ḫarû temple at Babylon";
