<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/413107853%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Roman villa of Cortijo Robledo";
    rdfs:comment "A Roman villa rustica dated between the first and fifth centuries. The site occupies a low hill located to the south of Cerro de Robledo, near the Roman settlement of Aratispi. Archaeological fieldwork has demonstrated that the site was involved in the production of olive oil until the later Roman period.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/413107853> .

