    rdfs:label "S. Erasmo di Cesi";
    rdfs:comment "An ancient settlement, architectural complex featuring polygonal masonry, and associated burials at modern S. Erasmo di Cesi dates to the archaic period and has evidence for activity through the third century BCE.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/413297> .

