    rdfs:comment "A small temple on the Acropolis of Athens that might have existed from the 470s B.C. until replaced by the Erechtheion, perhaps in the 420s B.C. It might have hosted the cult of Athena Polias and/or Erechtheus.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/418714190> .

