    rdfs:label "Campoverde";
    rdfs:comment "Campoverde (Lazio) lies some 60 km south of Rome. In 1977-1978 a quantity of votive material was recovered from a body of water known as the \"Laghetto del Monsignore\". This spring-fed body of water was interpreted as an open-air votive depository.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/422862> .

