    rdfs:label "Marmenia";
    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/356966898%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "The Domus Marmeniae is a villa located on the Via Appia near the fourth milestone. The villa grounds hosted a pagan necropolis and tradition holds that the matrona, Marmenia, relocated the body of St. Urban to a mausoleum built on the grounds.";
