    rdfs:comment "The larger of the two temples at Abu Simbel, dedicated to the triad of Amun, Ra-Horakhty, and Ptah, as well as the deified Ramesses II. The temple was relocated between 1964 and 1968 to prevent its submersion under Lake Nasser after the construction of the Aswan High Dam.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/424487311> .

