    rdfs:label "Ibis Nome";
    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/727159%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "15th Lower Egyptian Nome in the Pharaonic period, dedicated to the god Thoth and with its capital at Hermopolis. The site was called Djeḥuti/Tehut in Ancient Egyptian. This nome was incorporated into the Mendesios Nome during the Ptolemaic reforms of the 4th century BCE.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/429129177> .

