<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/432707/imagery-location-modern-via-veiove> dcterms:creator <https://pleiades.stoa.org/author/thomase>;
    dcterms:description "Central point of the modern road named in memory of the sanctuary and its presumed titular deity. Location determined in Google Earth with reference to 2017 articles in il Centro. Note that initial excavations and test pits are visible ahead of the road construction that was temporarily halted for rescue archaeology in Google Earth imagery dated 10/28/2017.";
    dcterms:modified "2025-08-14T21:40:16-04:00";
    dcterms:title "Imagery Location: modern Via Veiove";
    owl:sameAs <http://pleiades.stoa.org/places/432707/imagery-location-modern-via-veiove> .

