<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/452563773%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Assur Archive 52b";
    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/87246780%23this>,
        <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/893945%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "In a fill from private house in Room 1A2 (in area eA8V), excavators discovered an archive of 15 texts, belonging to a group of Egyptians. Some of these people have Egyptian names, others have Assyrian names. Available datings belong to a period of some 30 years in the mid-7th century BC. The archive consists of legal documents.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/452563773> .

