    dcterms:title "Egišhurankia";
    owl:sameAs <http://pleiades.stoa.org/places/452758807/egishurankia> .

<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/452758807/ehursagankia> dcterms:creator <https://pleiades.stoa.org/author/jnovotny>;
    dcterms:description "One text gives the Sumerian ceremonial name of the temple of the goddess Bēlet-Ninūa as Ehursagankia (“House, Mountain of Heaven and Underworld”).";
