<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/454350149%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Grotta del Tasso di Sofignano";
    rdfs:comment "The Grotta del Tasso di Sofignano (also referred to as Buca del Tasso) is a cave located near Camaiore in the province of Lucca in Italy. The cave is an archaeological site where the presence of Homo neanderthalensis is attested ca. 40,000 years ago.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/454350149> .

