<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/464482220%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Sanctuary of Apollo at Cyrene";
    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/373778%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "A sanctuary at Cyrene dedicated to Apollo Karneios. The sanctuary was in use between the seventh century BC and the second century AD, and included shrines to other gods, including Artemis and Isis. ";
