<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/465188488%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "La Almoloya";
    rdfs:comment "La Almoloya, located in south-eastern Spain, is an archaeological site connected with the El Argar society of the Early Bronze Age. The site includes especially wealthy burials and a sprawling architectural complex that some scholars have equated with a sort of meeting hall or parliament.";
