    rdfs:label "Larisa Fortress (Argolid)";
    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/327455663%23this>,
        <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/570106%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "An ancient fortified acropolis of Argos, located on the hill named Larisa, which is located to the northwest of the town. The site is now occupied by a Venetian castle that incorporates or covers architectural and archaeological remains dating from the Mycenaean period through the 19th century.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/492759697> .

