<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/403260%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Portus Herculis";
    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/403179%23this>,
        <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/699782783%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "Portus Herculis is located on the eastern side of the Monte Argentario peninsula, about 40 km south-east of Grosseto and about 7 km south-west of Orbetello. and about 12 km from Porto Santo Stefano. The site was in use as a port during the Etruscan, Roman, and Late Antique phases of occupation. It is included on the Peutinger map and in the Itinerarium Maritimum.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/403260> .

