<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/416806%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Fanum Voltumnae";
    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/413373%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "A shrine of Voltumna that served as the chief religious center of Etruria. The Etruscan League (duodecim populi Etruriae) was said to meet annually at the shrine. Archaeological excavations of the site of Campo della Fiera have been posited as the definitive location of the Fanum Voltumnae.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/416806> .

