    dcterms:coverage "Fosso della Crescenza";
    dcterms:creator <http://viaf.org/viaf/12320449>,
        <http://viaf.org/viaf/46755947>;
    dcterms:description "John Ward-Perkins identified the archaeological site at Fosso della Crescenza during the South Etruria Survey. Excavations of a Iulio-Claudian mausoleum were undertaken in 1962. Additional excavation revealed portions of the Via Veientana. Post-excavation work did not occur until the 1980s, by which time Fentress 1983 notes that the archaeological landscape had been largely eradicated by the burgeoning growth of suburban Rome.";
