<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/434772637%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Temple of Divus Augustus (Rome)";
    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/173078007%23this>,
