    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/432739%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "Vicus Esquilinus is a district connected with Cales in Campania.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/438881> .

<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/438882%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
