    dcterms:bibliographicCitation "Chronique en ligne Report 1644: DRYMON ARCHONTOCHORI - 2000 (and earlier linked records)",
        "SEG Online 53-499. Alyzeia (area of Drymonas Archontochoriou). Stamped roof tiles, Hellenistic period.",
