<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/462446%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Pizzo Cilona";
    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/462492%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "Writing in BTCGI, Giacomo Scibona indicates that a fortified site dating to the Archaic period was identified at Pizzo Cilona in 1985. This place is located along the road from Caronia to Samperi and occupies a commanding position.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/462446> .

