<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/472032%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Tharros";
    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/472014%23this>,
        <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/737899462%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "An ancient Phoenician settlement located in western Sardinia on a promontory in the Gulf of Oristano, just south of modern San Giovanni di Sinis. While it originates as a Punic or Carthaginian settlement ca. 700 BCE, it continued as a major town in Roman times.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/472032> .

