<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/477295678> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>,
        <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/vocab#Place>;
    dcterms:bibliographicCitation "Ciotti 1991 ",
        "Monacchi 2003 ",
