    rdfs:comment "The \"Castello di Decima\" is a fortified complex located in the frazione of Castel di Decima. The fortification is located at the tenth mile of the ancient Via Laurentina. The fortification dates to the early Middle Ages. The earliest mention dates to 1081 when there is mention of a \"castrum pontis Decimi\".";
