    dcterms:coverage "villa at Castelporziano";
    dcterms:creator <http://viaf.org/viaf/12320449>,
        <http://viaf.org/viaf/46755947>;
    dcterms:description "Since antiquity, the 6,000-ha estate at Castelporziano has been an elite seaside compound. Where a modern pleasure villa for the Italian president now sits are remains of Roman villas on the Laurentine shore; these remains have been the object of continued study since 1983.";
