    dcterms:bibliographicCitation "",
        "Wikidata Necropolis of Pranu Muttedu (Q2107814)",
        "Wikipedia (Italian) Complesso archeologico di Pranu Muttedu";
    dcterms:creator <https://pleiades.stoa.org/author/jbecker>;
    dcterms:description "Pranu Muttedu is a pre- and protohistoric archaeological site located near Goni, Sardinia. The complex includes standing stones (menhirs) and prehistoric built tombs (domus de janas). The site dates to the Late Neolithic (3200 – 2800 BC) and Early Chalcolithic (2800 – 2600 BC) periods.";
